    "Three models, downloaded once. Together they replace what cloud meeting apps do — on your Mac.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Drei Modelle, einmal geladen. Zusammen ersetzen sie, was Cloud-Meeting-Apps leisten — direkt auf dem Mac."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tres modelos, descargados una sola vez. Juntos sustituyen lo que hacen las apps de reuniones en la nube — en tu Mac."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Trois modèles, téléchargés une seule fois. Ensemble, ils remplacent ce que font les apps de réunion cloud — sur votre Mac."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tre modelli, scaricati una sola volta. Insieme sostituiscono ciò che fanno le app per riunioni in cloud — sul tuo Mac."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Timestamped trace of TOM's runtime (recording, AI routing, downloads, errors). Useful when debugging a release build.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zeitgestempeltes Protokoll der TOM-Laufzeit (Aufnahme, KI-Routing, Downloads, Fehler). Hilfreich beim Debuggen eines Release-Builds."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
